            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The objective of the study is to provide a better understanding of the possibilities for optimizing the central issue of VOG NP, including the assessment of the applicant and the work procedures. The definition of the problem is threefold:<br>• How can the interested parties (the organisations that ask persons to submit a VOG NP) and the applicants be characterised?<br>• How satisfied are interested parties with the central assessment and issue of VOG NP?<br>• Which adjustments of the work procedures are necessary in order to optimize the centralissue of VOG NP?</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
